    "intro_narrative": "You have just stepped into the dimly lit, abandoned office of the infamous 'Cipher Killer'. The room is cluttered with strange mechanical gadgets, humming terminals, and heavy steel locks. The air is thick with dust and the quiet ticking of hidden mechanisms. Your objective is clear: trace the flow of hidden data, operate the complex machinery in the correct sequence, and uncover the final password to unlock the master safe before the killer returns. Every device in this room is part of a larger, interconnected web. You must carefully follow the clues and pass the evidence through the right machines to reveal the truth.",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
